TablePilot

This product contains code from DBX (https://github.com/t8y2/dbx),
with reviewed non-AI changes through v0.6.45, commit
13b6acafed41e1ce65d5e97344e7e93cb88202c2.
DBX is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
Original copyright and third-party notices are retained in the source tree.

TablePilot is an independent modified desktop edition. It removes AI/MCP
runtime integration and the upstream app updater, changes application and
credential-store identity, and supplies its own Windows/Linux build workflow.
It is not an official DBX release. See FORK_CHANGES.md for the modification list.

TablePilot includes the unchanged Tailwind stylesheet from shadcn-vue 2.8.2.
